## Verification boundaries

<ul><% audit['limitations'].each do |limitation| %><li><%= escape(limitation) %></li><% end %></ul>

This audit does not rewrite native Home Assistant translations, device names, permissions or automation logic. It does not implement the proposed specifications or component changes. Those changes need the appropriate implementation and live verification work after the proposals have been assessed.
